# Ignore everything in .claude/ except shared infrastructure. The
# refresh-festivals skill is referenced by lefthook, so it lives in
# the repo. (You can't re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded — hence the wildcard-then-exception form.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/**
